      "id": "claim_9d1f18dfc44e4e6fbdee2a04005a5c90",
      "statement": "Open SWE splits responsibility between the backend and the separate `mda/` Managed Deep Agents project: MDA owns the model loop, checkpoints, tool calls, and surrounding middleware, while the backend plans each run and provides typed authenticated `POST /agent-api/{endpoint}` calls using a signed run token.",
